3. 
backend/quantum/simulator.py
Sequence verified:
Circuit is transpiled and theoretical Statevector.from_instruction(qc) is evaluated BEFORE measurement.
Density matrix & partial trace are calculated per qubit via compute_bloch_coordinates(sv, num_qubits).
qc.measure_all() is appended, followed by simulation via AerSimulator().run(..., shots=1024).
